  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception-action cycle: it senses obstacles (uncontrollable events) and executes motion commands (controllable events). The specification constrains the robot to prefer forward movement when clear, to recover deterministically from obstacles, and to avoid unsafe actions (e.g., never move_forward when obstacle_front). Each obstacle state enables exactly one recovery action, and all uncontrollable events are handled deterministically in every state.",
